        {
            "content": "Alright, so let me explain how our pricing works for Tuesdays. We charge $208 per hour for two movers and one truck and we provide 26 foot box truck with everything needed. Everything is included in the hourly rate, like the fuel and truck taxes, insurance, all wrap pads and bans to protect your items when they move and all the tools for this assembly and reassembly of your furniture and appliances. There are no hidden fees of any type, no credit card fees, no transportation fees, no Terell fees, no disassemble or reassembly fees. Again no hidden fees of any type. In addition to that, we have extra, extra perks that our customers really have, first, we have no worries, damage coverage. We provide up to $2,000 per move to repair, replace and reimburse for any accidental damages.",
